<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Buildmax announces results of rights offer.</title>
<headline>Buildmax announces results of rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buildmax Ltd said on Friday that shareholders had subscribed for 85.20 percent of the 14.32 million shares on offer in its rights offer.</p>
<p>The balance of 2.39 million shares had been taken up by the underwriter of the offer Mycom South Africa (Pty) Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said that following Mycom's acquisition of shares in Buildmax and the shares acquired through the rights offer, Mycom now held a controlling stake in Buildmax.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
